# ishliayol.uz / ishliayol.uz — environment templates

## Local frontend (.env)

```env
VITE_API_URL=/api
VITE_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

VITE_SUPER_ADMIN_PHONE=+998900707081
VITE_SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_password
VITE_SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL=superadmin@ishliayol.uz

VITE_USE_EMULATOR=false
VITE_AI_MOCK_MODE=true
```

## Production frontend — see `.env.production.example` (https://ishliayol.uz)

## Local API (api/.env)

```env
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://qulay_ish:qulay_ish_dev@localhost:5432/qulay_ish
JWT_SECRET=change-me-in-production
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=30d
API_PORT=4000
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000,https://localhost,capacitor://localhost

SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL=superadmin@ishliayol.uz
SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_password
SUPER_ADMIN_PHONE=+998900707081

# DevSMS — faqat api/.env da
DEVSMS_TOKEN=
DEVSMS_SERVICE_NAME=ishliayol.uz
```

## Capacitor / APK frontend — see `.env.capacitor`

```env
VITE_API_URL=https://ishliayol.uz/api
VITE_AI_MOCK_MODE=false
```

## Production API — see `api/.env.production.example`
## Nginx — see `nginx-config.conf` (ishliayol.uz + /api proxy)
## Mobile — see `MOBILE.md`


